+# v0.5 — grouped multi-token GEMM
+
+- Baseline is v0.4 expert-grouped RC1, not v0.3 token-major.
+- Add native s2/s8 DPAS RepeatCount 4 and 8 to paired gate/up and down.
+- Add per-call GPU compact tile descriptors; no host tile-count readback.
+- Preserve s2tile8, G32/H32 quantizers, per-token/group scales, gluquant,
+  original slot outputs, route summation order, split1/1 and local4.
+- Tail rows are zero-padded within each expert; no cross-expert tile.
+- Add RC4/8 integer probe, tile planner probe, same-build paired A/B,
+  input frame snapshots, tile histograms and build/source/argv provenance.
+- No Vulkan interop/server integration or GPU performance claim.
+- Authored against attached v0.4 archive, not an unseen local merged-tree diff.
+
 # v0.4 — one optimization: stable per-expert job grouping
 
 - GPU count/prefix/stable-scatter builds a fresh job permutation every invocation.
